{"id":"416559051d6f8f46","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-recursion.md","title":"Kleene 递归定理","display":"thm-recursion — Kleene 递归定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-recursion","aliases":["20-thm-recursion"],"display":"thm-recursion — Kleene 递归定理","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 2.2.1","source_pdf_pages":[65],"source_printed_pages":[29],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-recursion — Kleene 递归定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.2.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>65</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ [\\varphi_n=\\varphi_{f(n)}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ [\\varphi_n=\\varphi_{f(n)}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由 s-m-n 得全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(x)\">\\(d(x)\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{d(x)}(z)\\simeq\\varphi_{\\varphi_x(x)}(z)\">\\(\\varphi_{d(x)}(z)\\simeq\\varphi_{\\varphi_x(x)}(z)\\)</span>。取程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto f(d(x))\">\\(x\\mapsto f(d(x))\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=d(a)\">\\(n=d(a)\\)</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_n=\\varphi_{\\varphi_a(a)}=\\varphi_{f(d(a))}=\\varphi_{f(n)}\">\\(\\varphi_n=\\varphi_{\\varphi_a(a)}=\\varphi_{f(d(a))}=\\varphi_{f(n)}\\)</span>。固定的是外延函数，不要求自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=f(n)\">\\(n=f(n)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.2.1；印刷页 29；PDF 第 65 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d